"geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d_243" value="tryEnterMain() 三个入口共用，靠「栈顶已是 app.Main 就 return」这道闸门保证幂等：&lt;br&gt;① aboutToAppear 补查（灯比页面早亮）　② @Monitor(session.loggedIn)（灯比页面晚亮）&lt;br&gt;③ submit() 返回后兜底：从主页按返回键退回登录页再登录，灯本来就亮着，@Monitor 见不到 false→true 跳变&lt;br&gt;根因：@Monitor 只对「变化」敏感，对「已经是 true」无感 —— 这就是回退后登录进不去主页（10-13 10:48 修）" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#3A3A3A;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2012" y="1376" width="400" height="142" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d_244" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#B0B0B0;strokeWidth=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d_243"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1669" y="1447" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="d_245" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;endSize=7;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#1F4E79;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1669" y="1548" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1473" y="1548" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="d_246" value="replacePathByName(app.Main)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F4E79;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1473" y="1524" width="196" height="21" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d_247" value="" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;dashed=0;endSize=7;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#1F4E79;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1473" y="1600" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1865" y="1600" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="d_248" value="MainPage 入栈" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F4E79;spacing=3;" v